flowchart TD
    A[Apple event accepted] --> B[RUNNING<br/>Process one bounded batch]
    B --> L{Work complete?}
    L -->|Yes| M[COMPLETED<br/>Return result and release context]
    L -->|No| C{Pause signal?}
    C -->|No| D[Checkpoint completed batch]
    D --> B
    C -->|Yes| E[PAUSE_REQUESTED<br/>Stop new object discovery]
    E --> F[DRAINING<br/>Release one cleanup slice]
    F --> G[Drain autorelease pool<br/>Yield to run loop]
    G --> H{Compact paused state reached?}
    H -->|No| F
    H -->|Yes| I[PAUSED<br/>Retain queue, cursor, and visited summary]
    I --> J{Low-water stable and resume requested?}
    J -->|Wait| I
    J -->|Resume| K[RESUMING<br/>Restore and validate checkpoint]
    K --> B
    B -. Emergency ceiling .-> O[EMERGENCY_FROZEN<br/>Preserve requester, responder, and checkpoint]
    F -. Emergency ceiling .-> O
    O --> P[Operator-directed resume or clean restart]
    P --> F
